  RELEVANCE: This short but widely cited intervention clarifies the intellectual
  landscape of Domain 6, distinguishing between traditions that are sometimes
  conflated in discussions of the critique of Enlightenment reason. It helps
  locate where different critics of Kant and Hegel stand methodologically.

  POSITION: Postcolonial and decolonial traditions are complementary but
